.cursor
server/skills-lock.json
server/.agents/
# graphify: everything under graphify-out/ is derived from the source tree and
# is rebuilt by `graphify .` in seconds, so only the human-readable report is
# tracked. graph.json and graph.html are ~2MB of generated data that would go
# stale on every code change; cache/ is content-addressed scratch; the dotfiles
# pin an absolute interpreter path from whichever machine last built the graph.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
